 "short_name": "Umvoti",
 "_doc": "Umvoti Local Municipality (Greytown) 'TAX INVOICE / STATEMENT' (same ledger family as Mthonjaneni but comma decimals): masthead 'VAT Reg No:' - the municipality prints two different numbers across this folder (4000791816 on 7 files, 4850122930 on the 3 mid-2025 files), so the fingerprint is 'UMVOTI LOCAL MUNICIPALITY' + either VAT. Month / Statement Date / Due Date / Account / Amount Due, then a ledger (Date | Reference | Description | Tax | Debit | Credit | Balance; Debit is VAT-inclusive, '4 136,41' money): 'Electricity Basic Commercial- R<ex>' (ex VAT printed in the description), refuse lines '@ R<ex>', 'E-D <meter> Electricity Consumption <n>KWH - [start to end]' with a Units/Rates sub-table, 'E- <meter> Electricity Demand Charge <n>KVA' with its own sub-table, aging strip and a 'Vat' statement total. The VAT column drops trailing zeros ('435,6'), which the money parser would read 100x too big, so it is never read per line; the 4-decimal comma kWh rate ('2,1996') is rebuilt via concat with a '.' taken from the bill. total_ex_vat_r = basic (description) + kWh x rate + kVA x rate; standard_r = energy, demand_r = demand, other_r = basic. Statement date is billing_date. One file set (3 identical copies of the Feb 2026 statement) bills four months (Nov-Feb) at once: Rands and kWh are summed over all periods, readings run first start -> last end, demand_kva is the latest period's kVA while demand_r covers all four. IDENTITY umv_ident_ex = electricity Debits - (statement Vat - refuse VAT, refuse VAT = refuse Debits - refuse description price): 0.00/<=0.01 on 9/10; the June 2025 bill is off by R26.99 because its own refuse 'add' line charges R258.32 ex while its description says R285.32 (electricity VAT / 0.15 still matches total_ex there). No reading dates, tariff name or deposit printed. Checked on 10 bills.",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "UMVOTI LOCAL MUNICIPALITY"
  ],
  "any": [
   "4000791816",
   "4850122930"
  ],
  "reject_if_text": []
 },
 "sections": {
  "electricity": {
   "start": "^[ \\t]*Balance Brought Forward\\b",
   "require": "Electricity (?:Basic|Consumption|Demand)"
  },
  "sundry": {
   "start": "^[ \\t]*180 Days[ \\t]+150 Days"
  }
 },
 "fields": [
  {
   "field": "account_number",
   "label": "Account",
   "scope": "document",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]*Account[ \\t]+(\\d{5,})\\b",
